hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1714","Ali ibn Bahr narrated to us, Isa ibn Yunus narrated to us, Uthman ibn Hakim narrated to us, Khalid ibn Salamah narrated to us that Abdul-Hamid ibn Abdur-Rahman invited Musa ibn Talhah when he married his son, and said: O Abu Isa, what has reached you regarding prayer upon the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him? Musa said: I asked Zayd ibn Kharijah about prayer upon the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and Zayd said: I asked the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, myself and said: How is prayer upon you? He said: Pray and strive, then say: O Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad as You blessed Ibrahim; indeed You are Praiseworthy, Glorious."
